-- Auth email templates.
--
-- Generated by scripts/generate-auth-email-templates.ts from
-- volumes/auth/templates/*.html. Do not edit by hand: change the HTML and
-- re-run the generator.
--
-- GoTrue asks the email webhook for these by slug — "confirmation" for a
-- signup — and the webhook looks the slug up in this table. The six rows
-- were never here, so every signup's email hook answered 502 ("No fallback
-- template available for slug: confirmation"), GoTrue rolled the signup
-- back, and no account was ever created.
--
-- The placeholders are the variables the webhook passes: site_url,
-- action_link, token, redirect_to, email and new_email.


